@startuml
title 26B. Employee Engagement - Survey and Feedback
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #546E7A
  ArrowColor #607D8B
  DiamondBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
  DiamondBorderColor #546E7A
}
skinparam partition {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #90A4AE
}
|HR Staff|
start
:Create engagement survey;
:Choose anonymous or identified mode;
:Send survey;

|Employee|
:Complete survey;
:Submit feedback;

|System|
:Store responses;
:Aggregate engagement metrics;
:Protect anonymity where configured;

|HR / Management|
:Review trends and concerns;
:Create follow-up action plan;
stop
@enduml
